    "readme_excerpt": "# py-builder-signing-sdk Python SDK for Polymarket builder authentication and signing. ## Installation ```bash pip install py-builder-signing-sdk ``` ## Usage ```python from py_builder_signing_sdk import BuilderConfig, BuilderApiKeyCreds, RemoteBuilderConfig # Local signing creds = BuilderApiKeyCreds( key=\"your-api-key\", secret=\"your-secret\", passphrase=\"your-passphrase\" ) config = BuilderConfig(local_builder_creds=creds) # Remote signing remote_config = RemoteBuilderConfig( url=\"http://localhost:3000/sign\", token=\"your-auth-token\" # optional ) config = BuilderConfig(remote_builder_config=remote_config) # Generate signed headers headers = config.generate_builder_headers(\"POST\", \"/order\", '{\"data\": \"example\"}') ```",
